Bar now fades the page content in and out while the bar itself stays fixed and untouched (`internal/docker/appbar.go:193`). Arrival is detected from `document.referrer` so the incoming app fades in; `prefers-reduced-motion` or no CSS-transition support falls straight through to a normal navigation, and bfcache restores clear any half-faded inline styles.

Verified: `make test` passes, `make lint` reports `0 issues`; dumped script also passed `node --check`.
